Today is very hot.
Outside, the sunshine is intense.
In the evening, it will rain.
But right now, it is morning.
I am going to the office.
Therefore, I want light clothes.
I open the cupboard.
There is a new shirt there.
It is a white-coloured shirt.
It is a cotton shirt.
Cotton clothes are excellent in hot weather.
I take that white shirt.
I put on the new shirt.
It is very comfortable.
I feel good now.
I take my bag.
I put the laptop in the bag.
Now I am ready.
I set out for the office.
